A connects
  A: pid,log_disconnections=(3704876, 'on')
SIGHUP: set_flag --force ysql_pg_conf_csv log_disconnections=off
A after SIGHUP, 5s, no new connections
  A: pid,log_disconnections=(3704876, 'on')
  A: pid,log_disconnections=(3704876, 'on')
new client D
  D: pid,log_disconnections=(3705758, 'off')
A after D
  A: pid,log_disconnections=(3705758, 'off')
